# Labs

- Labs are artifacts created during exercises — keep them practical and runnable
- After completing a lab, update `progress/learner-model.json` with mastery changes
- Include brief notes on what was practiced and any blockers encountered
- Prefer native hands-on work (CLI, configs) over theory-only writeups
